en:
What I can see of the princess's expression is,
if only for a moment, soft and sad--but the hard,
immense pressure she gives off quickly returns.

Y-You are grossly mistaken. I just... happened to
feel like visiting on my way back from the toilet;
that is all.

Tis all as planned. That cruel bastion that
safe-kept their fortress is now destroyed;
thy foe is laid bare before thee.

I ask that you return first, my liege, and prepare
for the welcoming of the caravan. Nosuri, Ougi,
Rulutieh, and Atuy shall accompany you.
